      "widgets_values": [
        "",
        "Cinematic film shot in a 90s apartment living room at night. A person enters from frame left, walks across the hardwood floor to the L-shaped tan sectional sofa and pauses. They stand and cross the room to the low wooden side table, leaning down near the chrome-base lava lamp with blue-green wax blobs (Prop 1, left side of room), adjusting the warm glass dome. The camera pushes in as the colorful wax light reflects across the space. They walk toward the CRT television with static screen (Prop 4, right side near bookshelf). Camera tracks the movement smoothly across the room. Warm amber practical lighting, deep shadows, 35mm film grain, 2700K interior, rain-streaked city window visible. Continuous motion, no cuts.",
